Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.65,0:00:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑雾！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.01,0:00:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻、攻击力100？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.79,0:00:35.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）难道说很弱？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.06,0:00:38.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）就凭那种 No.卡我怎么可能被打倒！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.09,0:00:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等，游马！这里先观察对手的情况！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.96,0:00:42.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.81,0:00:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能贸然攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.31,0:00:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用霍普攻击黑雾！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.51,0:00:49.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.03,0:00:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.61,0:00:51.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.22,0:00:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑斩击！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.45,0:01:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.84,0:01:05.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢了！大胜利！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.89,0:01:27.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害啊，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.14,0:01:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样！完胜！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.77,0:01:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看到了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.03,0:01:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，碰上本大爷{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.81,0:01:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么 No.怪兽啊根本就不是我的对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不就是赢了一把嘛……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.69,0:01:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 霍普的那次攻击那还真是有点太乱来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.90,0:01:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没关系的啦 那种 No.怪兽……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.08,0:01:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事谁说得准啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.61,0:01:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方是什么样的怪兽都还不知道呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.80,0:01:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 不是赢了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.02,0:01:54.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我有我自己的打法。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.85,0:01:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊 你那说法！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.20,0:01:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.95,0:01:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 想打架吗 你！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.74,0:02:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别闹了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.51,0:02:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马／铁男）哦……哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.06,0:02:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）啊……哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.25,0:02:21.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 决斗！今天和谁……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.85,0:02:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.47,0:02:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次 可能有点严重了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.93,0:02:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界的崩坏……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.49,0:02:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那也是我的记忆吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经3天了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.90,0:02:50.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么久没和铁男
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.54,0:02:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗过，还是头一回呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.47,0:02:58.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.72,0:03:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梦想是成为决斗冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.85,0:03:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，你这家伙决斗真的很强吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.05,0:03:09.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？可是我一次都没赢过……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.09,0:03:13.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊哈哈哈哈！你是白痴吗！？啊哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.14,0:03:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《然后那家伙就向我发起了挑战……》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.52,0:03:20.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才你竟敢笑话我。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.88,0:03:23.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不服气的话就赢给我看啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.52,0:03:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.09,0:03:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果是我惨败。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.78,0:03:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}即便如此，铁男
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.19,0:03:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他跟我决斗了好多次呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.83,0:03:34.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《铁男：那家伙输了又输{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.01,0:03:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}几乎每天都来向我挑战……》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.57,0:03:42.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对不会放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.94,0:03:46.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《铁男：看着那样的他决斗的样子，我……》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.43,0:04:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}道歉！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.54,0:04:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为总得有一方道歉吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.14,0:04:07.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！说起来本来就是那家伙不对吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.34,0:04:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你真的觉得这样就好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.05,0:04:11.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.70,0:04:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}朋友不就是每天交谈{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彼此交心的存在吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.39,0:04:18.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}朋友～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.79,0:04:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不稀罕那种家伙当什么朋友！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.49,0:04:25.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…不…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.63,0:04:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀～…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.57,0:04:32.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.79,0:04:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜呃！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.31,0:04:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.50,0:04:41.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都、都怪你吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.80,0:04:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁让你突然抓过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎…啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.48,0:04:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:04:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃、呜呜！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.03,0:05:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.55,0:05:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.48,0:05:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就是 No.96！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.01,0:05:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你、你在说什么啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.20,0:05:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（No.96的声音）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.49,0:05:18.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直在等这一刻。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.90,0:05:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}附身于你成为完全体的这一刻。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.27,0:05:25.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要毁掉…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.70,0:05:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把一切毁灭殆尽！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:33.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.03,0:05:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！咕啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.08,0:05:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎、怎么回事！？这玩意！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.08,0:05:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.10,0:05:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放开我！放开～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.62,0:05:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（No.96）没用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.69,0:05:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你已经逃不掉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.50,0:05:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！把霍普交给铁男。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.05,0:05:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把霍普！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.90,0:05:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}交出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.12,0:05:59.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.81,0:06:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊？霍普！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.00,0:06:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.70,0:06:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵 这样我就得到了最强的 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:13.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.49,0:07:48.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你、你这家伙 竟敢对星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 那边的小鬼把 No.交出来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.48,0:08:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么…！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.60,0:08:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男，刚才那个！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.50,0:08:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不知道。不过，说不定是这把钥匙的力量？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.36,0:08:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《既然如此，只要打倒这家伙把皇之钥匙交给游马{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.96,0:08:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定就能救游马》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.31,0:08:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡！既然你这么想要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.67,0:08:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在决斗中赢过我试试！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.03,0:08:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.37,0:08:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手！铁男，这家伙很危险！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.24,0:08:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快逃啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.25,0:08:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我怎么可能丢下你一个人跑啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.08,0:08:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}换成是你的话，你会逃吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.31,0:08:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你会丢下我逃跑吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.46,0:08:37.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.51,0:08:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵！有意思我来当你的对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.08,0:08:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（No.96／铁男）决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.93,0:08:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.62,0:08:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像 连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.65,0:08:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（No.96／铁男）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.35,0:08:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵… 你没有自由。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.38,0:08:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是我的仆人。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.90,0:09:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《不管对手是不是 星光体{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.75,0:09:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要是游马的卡组我都已经完全记在脑子里了》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.61,0:09:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻 我拿下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.06,0:09:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.66,0:09:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 召唤 眼眼铁！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.03,0:09:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（眼眼铁）眼 眼 眼～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.56,0:09:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着 我 将装备魔法 弹簧拳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:20.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备给眼眼铁！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.61,0:09:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 眼眼铁的怪兽效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.16,0:09:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次 攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.26,0:09:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力可以提升４００点！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.37,0:09:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这里，发动弹簧拳套的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备怪兽的攻击力提升时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.73,0:09:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那个攻击力的一半，也就是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.28,0:09:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}１０００点的伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.41,0:09:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.32,0:09:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.35,0:09:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.08,0:09:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.70,0:09:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我，我没事。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.09,0:09:51.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，尽管放马过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.59,0:09:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动永续魔法，发条弹射器，
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.44,0:09:57.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.65,0:09:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着我，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.06,0:10:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我马上就来救你！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.85,0:10:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵，我的回合，抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.03,0:10:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我特殊召唤小圆栗子。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以通过将１张手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.21,0:10:12.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地来特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.97,0:10:15.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，从手牌送去墓地的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.61,0:10:18.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}松果球可以特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.36,0:10:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}苏醒吧，松果球。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.24,0:10:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着我将暗黑共鸣者通常召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.81,0:10:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑共鸣者召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.12,0:10:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上的所有怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.40,0:10:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}属性变为暗属性，等级提升1。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.69,0:10:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级2的橡果球和松果球和
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑共鸣者进行叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.58,0:10:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.95,0:10:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.99,0:10:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，我的分身，No.96。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.73,0:11:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来自漆黑之暗的使者，黑色迷雾。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.27,0:11:00.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.81,0:11:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是黑色迷雾？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟之前完全不一样啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.34,0:11:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这才是黑色迷雾真正的样子。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.20,0:11:12.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用黑色迷雾攻击独眼巨人。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.74,0:11:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用攻击力100去攻击？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.27,0:11:18.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动黑色迷雾的怪兽效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.84,0:11:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用1个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.32,0:11:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽的攻击力减半{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.68,0:11:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将那个数值加到自己攻击力上。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.73,0:11:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗影增益。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.78,0:11:36.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那不就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.37,0:11:38.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必定会超过对方的攻击力吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.66,0:11:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。去吧，黑雾。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.03,0:11:45.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑幻影鞭。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.25,0:11:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.27,0:11:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放两张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.47,0:11:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是黑雾的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.65,0:11:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:02.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动永续魔法发条弹射器的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.57,0:12:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每当自己的回合到来时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.01,0:12:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放置一个发条计数器。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.78,0:12:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}计数器？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.39,0:12:09.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}计数器就是通过使用它{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.98,0:12:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能够发动效果的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.50,0:12:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}积攒计数器
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.65,0:12:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打算强化魔法卡的效果吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.21,0:12:21.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 铁皮金鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.75,0:12:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 从手牌发动铁呼。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.62,0:12:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在 场上有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.86,0:12:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机械族怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.32,0:12:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从墓地特殊召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.90,0:12:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级4以下的机械族怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.20,0:12:36.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧 铁铁鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.91,0:12:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着 从手牌发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.93,0:12:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁抽。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:44.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上有2只机械族怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.93,0:12:48.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}时候 从卡组抽2张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.35,0:12:52.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《铁男：游马 我一定会救你的》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.23,0:12:54.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 等级4的铁皮金鱼和
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.45,0:12:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁铁鱼叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.10,0:12:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.14,0:13:01.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.48,0:13:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤。 现身吧 No.39
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.82,0:13:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.92,0:13:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（霍普）霍～普。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.45,0:13:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出现了 No.39。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.66,0:13:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃… 这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 No.的力量。 唔 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:34.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 发动上发条弹射器的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.31,0:13:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个上发条计数器 这个回合
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.64,0:13:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的攻击力提升500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.88,0:13:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力3000。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.03,0:13:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好。 上 霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.59,0:13:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑雾的恐怖
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.72,0:13:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你似乎还没明白啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.97,0:13:53.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动黑雾的效果。 暗影增益。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.71,0:13:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？ 暗影增益的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.07,0:14:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是只有攻击的时候才发动吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.78,0:14:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的攻击力被夺走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.48,0:14:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上 黑雾。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.59,0:14:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.34,0:14:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑幻影鞭。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.86,0:14:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动霍普的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.22,0:14:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1只怪兽的攻击无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.92,0:14:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}月之护壁！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.79,0:14:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.04,0:14:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼～。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.16,0:14:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 一切都在计算之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.35,0:14:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 反弹力。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.22,0:14:34.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗被无效化时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.07,0:14:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将进行战斗的怪兽的攻击力差值的数值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.11,0:14:40.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方玩家伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.98,0:14:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给铁男造成 1100点伤害！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.35,0:14:49.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.06,0:14:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.24,0:14:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下 明白了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.60,0:14:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凭你这种人是打不倒我这种人的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.13,0:14:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜… 唔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.99,0:15:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.95,0:15:06.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《铁男：攻击时也被攻击时也{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.97,0:15:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力竟然会增加真是个不得了的怪兽》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.51,0:15:13.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咳… 抱歉啊 铁男。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.04,0:15:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.90,0:15:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《星光体 是你吗？》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.59,0:15:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 好好听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:28.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动永续魔法 自动发条机！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.52,0:15:31.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡发动时放置两个发条计数器{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.56,0:15:34.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 每当自己的回合到来时
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.15,0:15:36.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以增加一个。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.10,0:15:38.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 这张卡可以通过送入墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.63,0:15:40.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将发条计数器
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.53,0:15:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}移动到其他卡上。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.50,0:15:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还打算继续积攒计数器吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.03,0:15:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.73,0:15:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发条弹射器的效果消失{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.42,0:15:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的攻击力下降500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.29,0:16:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.00,0:16:01.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.46,0:16:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.19,0:16:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.73,0:16:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵……终于连这家伙也
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.04,0:16:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被我吸收进来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.95,0:16:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.98,0:16:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用黑雾攻击希望皇霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.35,0:16:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后发动怪兽效果。暗影增益！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.95,0:16:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的怪兽效果发动！月之屏障！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.66,0:16:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为这样就能守住吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.02,0:16:38.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱卡！超量光灭！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.55,0:16:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽使用超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.29,0:16:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动的效果无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.11,0:16:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧，黑幻影鞭！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.84,0:16:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.23,0:16:56.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.89,0:16:57.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.92,0:17:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，接下来把发条弹射器把它破坏掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.36,0:17:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.81,0:17:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在发条弹射器上聚集计数器{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.51,0:17:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打算让下次召唤的怪兽提升力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.54,0:17:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事我早就看穿了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.23,0:17:14.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.91,0:17:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.92,0:17:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙盯上的是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.92,0:17:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一击就能干掉你的一手。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.97,0:17:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一击干掉？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.03,0:17:25.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的盖牌是发条炸弹。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.02,0:17:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行，不能说啊，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.38,0:17:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.05,0:17:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听不到你们的声音。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.91,0:17:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发条炸弹是在自己的回合到来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.10,0:17:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}计数器增加时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.96,0:17:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上每有1个计数器
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.49,0:17:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就造成800点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.01,0:17:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}８００点？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.28,0:17:45.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下一回合　发条弹射器和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.22,0:17:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自动发条机的计数器
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.40,0:17:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}各自增加１个　合计４个。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.76,0:17:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说　造成的伤害是３２００点。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.64,0:17:56.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是那张卡发动了我们就输了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.67,0:17:59.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来是这么回事。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.36,0:18:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…　游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.88,0:18:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么只要把那张盖牌破坏掉就行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.08,0:18:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.95,0:18:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动速攻魔法　超量旋风！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.63,0:18:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在破坏了超量怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.67,0:18:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏１张陷阱卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《发条炸弹…》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.72,0:18:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我　就这样回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.08,0:18:23.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得好游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.26,0:18:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来　这场决斗　就是我赢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.30,0:18:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《可恶……游马》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.51,0:18:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对不会放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.04,0:18:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.40,0:18:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《没错如果是游马的话绝对不会放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.28,0:18:43.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发条弹射器？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.97,0:18:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.67,0:18:48.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.85,0:18:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.37,0:18:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《来了！》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.56,0:18:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我根据卡的效果给发条弹射器和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.76,0:18:58.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自动发条机各放置一个计数器！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.15,0:19:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（No.96）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.51,0:19:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 无谓的挣扎……。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.51,0:19:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）然后从自动发条机上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.59,0:19:08.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去除三个计数器{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.05,0:19:10.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌把这家伙……。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.07,0:19:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤发条式神！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.10,0:19:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（发条式机神）机神～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.46,0:19:17.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）发条式机神
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.93,0:19:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次，直到结束阶段{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.00,0:19:22.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手1只怪兽的攻击力变成0！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.69,0:19:24.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.41,0:19:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，从手牌发动魔法卡 死者苏生！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.12,0:19:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.98,0:19:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普复活了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.34,0:19:39.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这……这是怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.35,0:19:44.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿嘿嘿！嘿嘿嘿……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.07,0:19:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得漂亮，铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.59,0:19:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？这是怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.51,0:19:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.29,0:19:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马他只是装作被吞噬了而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.99,0:19:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时候，如果
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.87,0:19:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发条弹射器被你破坏掉的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.03,0:19:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就没有胜算了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.22,0:20:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 游马他假装被你吸收了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.09,0:20:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}保护了发条弹射器啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.94,0:20:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.13,0:20:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就凭你这种家伙我们的友情力量怎么可能会输给你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:14.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 发动发条弹射器的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.21,0:20:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过去除一个发条计数器
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.41,0:20:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让霍普的攻击力提升５００点！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.30,0:20:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力３０００！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.32,0:20:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经 没法使用黑雾的效果了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.49,0:20:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你输了 No.９６！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.72,0:20:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～ 铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.74,0:20:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我的 一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.01,0:20:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.37,0:20:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）霍普剑 斩击！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.79,0:20:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.99,0:21:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能… 我竟然～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.52,0:21:04.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 接住！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.02,0:21:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.55,0:21:24.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.07,0:21:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得漂亮，铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.79,0:21:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.43,0:21:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.62,0:21:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过你啊居然能想出那种逆转的连招。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.66,0:21:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？嘛……算是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.69,0:21:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？啊……果然，是星光体吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.23,0:21:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是啦。确实那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.95,0:21:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是给了点建议啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.45,0:21:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然……对游马来说这也太超常发挥了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.15,0:21:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊——。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.17,0:21:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底，都怪你不赶紧把那玩意儿打倒！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.36,0:21:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:55.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明帮了你，你这是什么态度。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.89,0:22:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，铁男……谢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.28,0:22:04.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.96……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.47,0:22:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这个 No.……》
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.28,0:22:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜从13只怪兽中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.96,0:22:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来决定第1名吧！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.49,0:22:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在节目主页投票吧！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.08,0:24:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜第1弹 举办中！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.09,0:24:18.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜13只当中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.44,0:24:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪只怪兽会被选为第1名{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.30,0:24:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一切全看你了＞

